# memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md

Copy this file to `memory/<today YYYY-MM-DD>.md` at boot when today's file is
absent. Raw session notes for that date. Concrete updates only; no empty
placeholders. Edit freely. After the session, durable outcomes can be folded
into MEMORY.md.

